! =====================================================================
! Mo hinh KHOI nhieu lop toan canh chinh CW - sinh tu gen_apdl_for_wing_SOLSH190.py
! NACA 4421, day cung 800 mm (|y| < 1.75) thuon ve 400 mm, sai -8..8 m, ngam tai y = +-0.26 m (all)
! Don vi SI (m, kg, N, Pa).  x: huong ve phia truoc, y: doc sai, z: len
! Vo = 3 tang (woven ngoai / loi / woven trong), mu dam = tang A + B; mu dam + side cap offset thang dung
! SOLSH190: lop 1 o mat I-J-K-L; chieu day lop duoc co gian theo chieu day that cua phan tu
! SOLID185: foam bung dam, foam lap mep sau
! Huong 0 do cua lop vo / bung dam: doc sai (LOCAL 11); rib: truc x tong the
! =====================================================================
FINISH
/CLEAR,NOSTART
/TITLE,CW main wing - layered solid model (SOLSH190)
/PREP7
/NERR,200,10000
ET,1,SOLSH190
ET,2,SOLSH190
ET,3,SOLSH190
ET,4,SOLSH190
ET,5,SOLSH190
ET,6,SOLSH190
ET,7,SOLID185
KEYOPT,7,2,2           ! enhanced strain, tranh khoa cat
ET,8,SOLSH190
ET,9,SOLID185
KEYOPT,9,2,2           ! enhanced strain, tranh khoa cat
! TYPE 1: Vo thuong (3 tang)
! TYPE 2: Vo vung dam - dai gia cuong (3 tang)
! TYPE 3: Mu dam (tang A, B)
! TYPE 4: Side cap (tang A)
! TYPE 5: Thanh bung dam truoc
! TYPE 6: Thanh bung dam sau
! TYPE 7: Foam bung dam
! TYPE 8: Rib
! TYPE 9: Foam lap mep sau
!
